00:19:22.961 --> 00:19:24.529
Ah, that's beautiful.

00:19:24.562 --> 00:19:27.632
All right,
so after all that,

00:19:27.665 --> 00:19:31.469
it can feel easy
to get pretty down
on ever seeing,

00:19:31.502 --> 00:19:35.807
ever witnessing
real life teleportation,
which I get.

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:39.644
But I love this switch
that we flipped,

00:19:39.677 --> 00:19:42.314
where instead
